@page "/ethos"

<PageTitle>Ethos - Muhammad Kashif-Khan</PageTitle>

<article class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 pb-16 pt-10 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="mb-10 font-mono text-xs text-slate-400">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-cy">home</a>
        <span class="mx-1.5">/</span>
        <span class="text-slate-300">ethos</span>
    </nav>

    <header class="mb-12">
        <p class="mono-label mb-3">// how I work</p>
        <h1 class="mb-5 max-w-4xl text-4xl font-extrabold leading-tight tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl">Ethos</h1>
        <p class="mb-3 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-300">My philosophy on technology, responsibility, and human-AI collaboration</p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-8">
        <!-- Responsibility and Sustainability -->
        <div>
            <ProjectSection Title="Responsibility and Sustainability" Icon="fas fa-leaf">
                <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                    For me, technology isn't just about solving problems. It's about doing so responsibly. As a Muslim, I take seriously the idea of preventing corruption on the earth, and that translates into how I think about my work: building systems that are sustainable, ethical, and genuinely useful.
                </p>
                <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                    I believe that what we create should improve lives without adding unnecessary complexity or harm.
                </p>
                </ProjectSection>
        </div>

        <!-- Living with AI -->
        <div>
            <ProjectSection Title="Living with AI, Not Competing Against It" Icon="fas fa-robot">
                <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                    AI is changing the way we code. Routine tasks that once took hours can now be handled in minutes. But I've also seen first-hand that the real challenge lies before the coding even begins, in the planning, the design, and the clear understanding of algorithms and workflows.
                </p>
                <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                    Whether I'm collaborating with an AI tool or with a team, the groundwork we put in is what determines success.
                </p>
                </ProjectSection>
        </div>

        <!-- Human Skill Still Matters -->
        <div>
            <ProjectSection Title="Why Human Skill Still Matters" Icon="fas fa-brain">
                <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                    Working in biotech projects has shown me the limits of AI. It can speed things up, but it can't handle every bug, every nuance, or every messy real-world problem. That's where human judgment still matters.
                </p>
                <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                    I've learned to step in where automation falls short, to diagnose, untangle, and see the bigger picture.
                </p>
                </ProjectSection>
        </div>

        <!-- My Approach -->
        <div>
            <ProjectSection Title="My Approach" Icon="fas fa-compass">
                <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                    I see my role as going beyond what's expected of a "junior developer." My strength lies in combining technical skill with perspective: knowing when to trust the machine, when to question it, and how to design workflows that make the best of both worlds.
                </p>
                <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                    For me, coding isn't just about output. It's about clarity, responsibility, and impact.
                </p>
            </ProjectSection>
        </div>

        <!-- Call to Action -->
        <div class="text-center">
            <div class="surface p-6 sm:p-8">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">Ready to Collaborate?</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-300 mb-6">
                    If you're looking for a developer who combines technical expertise with ethical responsibility and thoughtful collaboration, I'd love to hear from you.
                </p>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
                    <a href="/projects" class="btn-primary">
                        <i class="fas fa-rocket mr-2"></i>View My Work
                    </a>
                    <a href="/#contact" class="btn-ghost">
                        <i class="fas fa-envelope mr-2"></i>Get In Touch
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
    
    </div>
</article>